From 21460af54b51d6632be5196a78118748149dd4dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Doctor Logix <doctor.logix@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 12:06:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Damage only marked textures in autonomous frames

Carry texture IDs marked by the embedder into autonomous reused-tree draws. Diff only matching TextureLayers for those frames while retaining Flutter's conservative all-texture behavior for ordinary framework frames, and preserve the ID set across retry tasks.
